<title>PHILIPPINES: Far East Bank 9-mth net 1.65 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Far East Bank 9-mth net 1.65 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Far East Bank and Trust Co posted a 23 percent gain to 1.65 billion pesos in the first nine months of 1996 from the year-earlier period of 1.34 billion pesos, JG Summit Holdings Inc said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>JG Summit is a major shareholder of Far East Bank. It has a 19 percent stake in Far East Bank.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
